        <summary>
          <para>Indicates that the call is an adhoc conference call. This property can be set for both incoming and outgoing calls. An adhoc conference call is formed using addConferenceParticipants(List), TelecomManager.addNewIncomingConference(PhoneAccountHandle,Bundle), or TelecomManager.startConference(List,Bundle), rather than by merging existing call using conference(Call).</para>
